<title>BERMUDA: LaSalle sets dutch auction price at $27/shr.</title>
<headline>LaSalle sets dutch auction price at $27/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaSalle Re Holdings Ltd said it expects to buy about 41 percent of the shares tendered in its Dutch auction self-tender for $27 each.</p>
<p>It said it expects to buy 3,703,703 shares of the 5,340,468 shares that were tendered at $27 each.</p>
<p>LaSalle said the results are on a preliminary basis and are not final.</p>
</text>
